Z||000001||theogre||08-04-99||08:46 AM||||No. The 700 TBI is a complete redesign. I would not count on it working properly with the older ECM. All it's electrical conections are differant, as are throtle cable hardware, and transmision cable.<p>Holly makes an improved TBI that is a dropin for the pre87 cars.
